{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aJRkvShRFg1792878315.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在西班牙有退休人士遊行示威，要求加強保障退休權益。</p><p></p><p>數以千計退休人士，周六在首都馬德里遊行反對退休金可能被削減，以及退休金體系可能私有化。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.MARCH-0130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264TThlU8ZBG1792878311.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>有遊行人士表示，擔心右翼政黨在11月大選獲勝執政，指右翼政黨的一貫做法就是把一切私有化。他們這次示威的目的是捍衛公共退休金及福利國家體制。首相桑切斯曾指責，右翼政黨計劃削弱跟通脹掛勾的退休金調升幅度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.299343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T21:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.802325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:38:07.133027+00:00","content_hash":"d675037a9f13ad1e067cc0582c29ac20f0644fed5d7c05b04fb85e96c21eabd7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.299343+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}